cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: LCS-Parcels
abstract: >-
  Lagrangian coherent structure (LCS) diagnostics on top of Parcels: the
  deformation gradient, the Cauchy-Green strain tensor, its eigen-analysis, and
  the finite-time Lyapunov exponent (FTLE), following Haller (2015). The package
  contains no Parcels code. It emits a particle set to release and ingests the
  advected positions to diagnose.
type: software
