      (WASCAL), Universidade Técnica do Atlântico (UTA), Mindelo, São Vicente,
      Cabo Verde
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-1452-7928
  - given-names: Willi
    family-names: Rath
    affiliation: GEOMAR Helmholtz Centre for Ocean Research Kiel
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1951-8494
repository-code: https://github.com/geomar-od-lagrange/lcs_parcels
url: https://lcs-parcels.readthedocs.io/
license: MIT
keywords:
  - lagrangian
  - coherent-structures
  - lcs
  - ftle
  - oceanography
  - parcels
